.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-admin-purchases-refund-for-fraud - Refund a purchase for fraud and block the buyer


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad admin purchases refund-for-fraud  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Refund a purchase, classify the refund as fraud, and block the buyer in a
single admin action. The buyer email is required as a sanity check against the
purchase record.

.PP
This is a compound action: the full purchase amount is refunded, the buyer is
blocked, any linked subscription is cancelled, and the seller receives a fraud
notice email. There is no partial-refund flag — fraud refunds always refund the
full remaining balance.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--email\fP=""
	Buyer email (required)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for refund-for-fraud


